Follow AGENTS.md in this repository. Summary: lovefengis data comes from the public read-only REST API (https://lovefengis.com/api/v1, spec https://lovefengis.com/openapi.json), the MCP server (https://lovefengis.com/mcp) or the CLI (npx lovefengis). Never quote prices from memory; read them live. Prices are TRY incl. VAT; type "from" is a starting price. No credentials needed. Send users to https://lovefengis.com/gorusme to start a project.
